      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of reviewers praise the veterinarians and support staff for their welcoming demeanour, thorough answers, and attentive bedside manner. A few critical reviews cite frustration with communication during emergency pet care, but overall sentiment regarding clinic staff remains overwhelmingly positive."
      }
    },
