        "en": "Gentle and patient pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note how kindly the medical team treats dogs and cats, even when pets are anxious or difficult to handle. Reviewers describe a calming and supportive environment where animals are examined with great patience, comfort, and care during appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
