      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable care with billing concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several clients appreciate the accessible pricing, free community cat spay and neuter services, and reasonable examination rates. However, sentiment is mixed due to severe complaints from owners who reported unexpected emergency charges and high upfront fees during critical visits."
      }
    }
